From 7c6297d8909686978de38690fd500f1dd9ab6ed0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kevin <36448536+millionsouls@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:49:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] fix(oauth2): Cap exchanged token lifetime (#1353)

Prevents an exchanged token from outliving the credential chain it represents.
Claim builder now caps the new expiry at the earliest of the config
access token expiry, the validated subject token's expiry, and the app
cred expiry.

Assisted-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

Signed-off-by: Kevin <36448536+millionsouls@users.noreply.github.com>
